  "description": "This multi-purpose tactical knife features a serrated edge for ripping through coarse material like bone or fiber, plus a sharp gutting hook. The composite material handle is bolted to the blade with hex nuts. It has been painted using a spider web-patterned hydrographic over a red base coat and finished with a semi-gloss topcoat.\\n\\n<i>Be careful where you walk, you never know where the web is spread</i>",
